								"content": "Children experiencing homelessness are the most vulnerable in our society, yet they go unseen, unheard, and underserved. That's why&nbsp;The Salvation Army&nbsp;started Project CATCH. These children's hopes and dreams are in jeopardy of going unrealized. But we see them, hear them, and strive to empower them.",
